@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@carId = WKLEJ-TU-ID-Z-GET-LISTY

### Wszystkie samochody
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/cars

### Samochód po id
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/cars/{{carId}}

### Nieistniejący (404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/cars/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### Dodanie
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/cars
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "brand": "Fiat",
  "model": "Panda",
  "doorsNumber": 5,
  "luggageCapacity": 225,
  "engineCapacity": 1242,
  "fuelType": "Petrol",
  "productionDate": "2020-04-10T00:00:00",
  "averageFuelConsumption": 5.6,
  "bodyType": "Hatchback"
}

### Aktualizacja
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/cars/{{carId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "brand": "Fiat",
  "model": "Panda Cross",
  "doorsNumber": 5,
  "luggageCapacity": 225,
  "engineCapacity": 1242,
  "fuelType": "Petrol",
  "productionDate": "2020-04-10T00:00:00",
  "averageFuelConsumption": 5.9,
  "bodyType": "SUV"
}

### Usunięcie
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/cars/{{carId}}
